CedarSharp is an independent, unofficial .NET integration for Cedar.
Cedar's policy language and engine are developed by the Cedar project and its
contributors. CedarSharp does not claim ownership of the Cedar engine or name.

Native builds use cedar-policy 4.13.0, licensed Apache-2.0.
Upstream: https://github.com/cedar-policy/cedar
Source commit: 324d3c09fc94ab91464ec340eb81e4b167deb6f5

Native build staging and packages include the licenses and notices of the
resolved Cargo dependencies alongside each native runtime. Preserve those files
when redistributing the native assets. No third-party .NET wrapper code is used.
